cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to Clawback in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Clawback: local, privacy-first email cleanup"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
authors:
  - name: "Clawback contributors"
abstract: >-
  Clawback is a local, privacy-first email cleanup tool: bulk unsubscribe and delete with a two-click double
  confirmation, a paid-subscription finder with savings per currency, proof-of-unsubscribe tracking,
  regional recurring-payment finders and data-deletion request drafts. It runs on the user's computer
  as a local web app and command-line tool.
repository-code: "https://github.com/sainisourabh1-oss/clawback"
url: "https://github.com/sainisourabh1-oss/clawback"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - email
  - unsubscribe
  - privacy
  - subscriptions
  - local-first
